Setup			modelB_nodiff

### Model B (Paper II), dust stage without dust diffusion.
### As shipped this is B_a; B_b and B_c differ only in Invstokes1.

### Disk

AspectRatio		0.05		Aspect ratio at R0
Sigma0			1.0		Density normalisation at R0
SigmaSlope		1.0		Surface density slope
FlaringIndex		0.25		Flaring index
Alpha			1.0e-2		Shakura-Sunyaev alpha
Beta			1.0		Cooling time in units of 1/Omega_K
Gamma			1.4		Adiabatic index

### Dust

Invstokes1		10.0		1/St: B_a 10, B_b 31.62, B_c 100
Epsilon			0.01		Dust-to-gas ratio at the release
DUST_HRATIO		1.0		Dust scale height in units of the gas one

### Floors and dust velocity caps (floor.cu)

GASFLOOR			1.0e-7	Gas density floor
DUSTFLOOR			1.0e-9	Dust density floor
ENERGYFLOOR			1.0e-10	Gas internal energy floor
DUST_TVCAP_FLAG			1	Terminal-velocity cap (1 = on)
DUST_TVCAP_FACTOR		2.0	Cap in units of the terminal drift
DUST_TVCAP_D2G_MAX		1.0e-3	Dust-to-gas ratio below which it may act
DUST_TVCAP_RHO_FLOOR_FACTOR	2.0e4	...and dust density below this times DUSTFLOOR
DUST_TVCAP_LOW_GAS_FLOOR_FACTOR	5.0e3	Profile cap where gas < this times GASFLOOR
DUST_TVCAP_VRATIO_OVERRIDE	8.0	Forced where |dv|/|v_g| exceeds this
DUST_TVCAP_MACH_OVERRIDE	8.0	Forced where |dv|/c_s exceeds this
DUST_TVCAP_Z_HG_RATIO		2.5	Altitude (in H) of the high-altitude override
RELATIVE_MEDIAN_CAP_FLAG	1	Relative-median cap (1 = on)
RELATIVE_MEDIAN_CAP_FACTOR	8.0	Cap on |v_d| in units of the neighbours' median

### Planet

PlanetConfig		planets/modelB_J3e-4.cfg
RocheSmoothing		0.6		Potential softening in Hill radii
Eccentricity		0.0
IndirectTerm		yes

### Mesh

Nx			768		Azimuthal zones
Ny			256		Radial zones
Nz			128		Colatitude zones

Xmin			-3.14159265358979323844
Xmax			3.14159265358979323844
Ymin			0.3
Ymax			2.3
Zmin			1.320796326794897
Zmax			1.820796326794897

OmegaFrame		1.0
Frame			G

### Damping zones (stockholm.c)

DampingZone		1.2
TauDamp			0.1

### Output

CFL			0.3
DT			0.314159265359	One orbit is 20 DT
Ninterm			100		Output every 5 orbits
Ntot			30000

OutputDir		@outputs/B_a_nodiff
